      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.42 (vs ₹0.09 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.42 (up from ₹0.09 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹77.7m (up 110% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹31.8m (up 343% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 41% (up from 19% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 44% per year but the company’s share price has fallen by 14% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings.",
